                <pb facs="0915" n="899" sameAs="frus:frus1949v06/pg899"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.MA
                    Palestine/4–649</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-06">April 6, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: In accordance with
                    Section 1 of the Joint Resolution providing for the authorization of a special
                    contribution by the United States for the relief of Palestine refugees (Public
                    Law 25, 81st Congress, approved March 24, 1949), I have today allocated
                    $8,000,000 to the Department of State from funds advanced by the Reconstruction
                    Finance Corporation under the provisions of Section 2 of the aforementioned Act,
                    which advance has been deposited with the Treasury of the United States, and
                    established under Appropriation Symbol No. 119/00043.</p>
                <p>These funds are to be used by the Department of State as a special contribution
                    to the United Nations for the purposes set forth in the resolution of the
                    General Assembly of the United Nations of November 19, 1948, providing for the
                    relief of Palestine refugees.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi> S. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Truman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
